{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/121559-rage-across-google-maps","id":121559,"title":"Rage Across Google Maps","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-29T01:14:39-07:00","id":121559,"title":"Rage Across Google Maps","content":"The last game I was in had a huge protectorate, spanning most of the Olympic Peninsula in the United States. Given the vast distances between sites of interest, important places on the bawn, and the scope of the bawn itself, I set up a custom Google map to give us all a better idea of where things were. This worked out pretty well, so I added Septs that the various characters had originated from, since visions had called Garou to the Olympics from all over. And that got me thinking on a larger scale...<br /> <br /> I give you <a href=\"https://mapsengine.google.com/map/edit?mid=zMs5hU48Utl8.kEi7ZJCM2TRQ\" target=\"_blank\">Rage Across Google Maps</a>, a map reference of Septs and Caerns across the World of Darkness.<br /> <br /> I'm still combing through books and making additions. Once I've finished with Garou territories, I'll see about Fera. The map is intended as a visual aid for storytellers and players alike, and all location entries should have their source cited so you know what book to open to learn more about that site. If there a book or page number missing, please let me know so I can fix it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><a href=\"http://thecyberrecord.net\" target=\"_blank\">The Cyber Record</a> is on the </span></b><a href=\"http://geomid.network\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Geomid.Network</span></b></a><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Activism is Gaian praxis</span></b></div> <div align=\"right\"> <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><a href=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" ><img itemprop=\"image\" data-align=\"center\" data-linktype=\"1\" data-linkurl=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" data-size=\"full\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-thumb-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center\" /></a></div><br /> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2810-yakecen-sings","name":"Yakecen-Sings","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2810_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-29T02:38:47-07:00","id":121586,"title":"","content":"Now THIS! Is frikken Awesome! thank you!<br /> Will there be an option maybe for active werewolf games to get their dot on your map?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-29T02:55:13-07:00","id":121589,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darling_Rose</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Will there be an option maybe for active werewolf games to get their dot on your map?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep! It's my intention to start on unofficial/non-book locations after all of the official ones are up, in a separate map layer. I'll probably also add permanent major Moon Bridges once I run out of other stuff to add.<br /> <br /> The site I made to host this map and the glyphs keeps going down, but theoretically it will have a submission form for custom locations once I'm ready for those. Alternatively (or maybe additionally) I'll use this thread for gathering submissions.<br /> <br /> There are some historical and lost Caerns that I'm deciding how to add, like the ones from Croatan Song. Not a lot of specific-location information available on them for obvious reasons...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><a href=\"http://thecyberrecord.net\" target=\"_blank\">The Cyber Record</a> is on the </span></b><a href=\"http://geomid.network\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Geomid.Network</span></b></a><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Activism is Gaian praxis</span></b></div> <div align=\"right\"> <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><a href=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" ><img itemprop=\"image\" data-align=\"center\" data-linktype=\"1\" data-linkurl=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" data-size=\"full\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-thumb-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center\" /></a></div><br /> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2810-yakecen-sings","name":"Yakecen-Sings","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2810_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-29T02:57:20-07:00","id":121591,"title":"","content":"I'm looking forward to the glyph library you mentioned as well in the other thread. I had someone helping me out with a map of Euthanatos tradition ranges once. Dunno whatever happened to it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-29T03:18:01-07:00","id":121595,"title":"","content":"Sounds like it's time to start a new one! The maps lite (what I'm using) is free and while it doesn't have a massive amount of options like pro, it's been getting the job done. It'd be really neat to see important sites in each of the genres.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><a href=\"http://thecyberrecord.net\" target=\"_blank\">The Cyber Record</a> is on the </span></b><a href=\"http://geomid.network\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Geomid.Network</span></b></a><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Activism is Gaian praxis</span></b></div> <div align=\"right\"> <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><a href=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" ><img itemprop=\"image\" data-align=\"center\" data-linktype=\"1\" data-linkurl=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" data-size=\"full\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-thumb-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center\" /></a></div><br /> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2810-yakecen-sings","name":"Yakecen-Sings","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2810_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-29T07:54:08-07:00","id":121695,"title":"","content":"I had a quick and rough google map done up of all Canon Kindred Domains (Sabbat/Camarilla/Indy as well as some Dark Ages) a bit back. I'll see can I dig it out and share it if you're interested in the data.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/836-obyrne","name":"Obyrne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar836_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"149"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-29T08:41:10-07:00","id":121725,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the post, this is certainly helpful...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-29T13:27:30-07:00","id":121944,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Obyrne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/121559-rage-across-google-maps?p=121695#post121695\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I had a quick and rough google map done up of all Canon Kindred Domains (Sabbat/Camarilla/Indy as well as some Dark Ages) a bit back. I'll see can I dig it out and share it if you're interested in the data.</div> </div> </div> </div>This would be incredibly useful.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-29T13:58:20-07:00","id":121966,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yakecen-Sings</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/121559-rage-across-google-maps?p=121589#post121589\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But theoretically it will have a submission form for custom locations once I'm ready for those. Alternatively (or maybe additionally) I'll use this thread for gathering submissions.<br /> <br /> There are some historical and lost Caerns that I'm deciding how to add, like the ones from Croatan Song. Not a lot of specific-location information available on them for obvious reasons...</div> </div> </div> </div>Also, what's your stance on caerns from Magazine adventures? I know the ones from White Wolf Magazine and Inphobia Magazine should be fine, but I know of a few from Non-White Wolf Magazines (Shadis Magazine had a caern located near the La Brea Tar Pits, Valkyrie Magazine had a ton of CWOD adventures, etc.). As well as caerns from White Wolf novels and anthologies?<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://laughinghyena.livejournal.com/102494.html\" target=\"_blank\">I have a old list of caerns and locations that I did for the Rage CCG fourms to use for the sources on cards, it hasn't been updated in a long time (So it doesn't have anything from W20 books)</a>.<br /> It should have page numbers and book titles, so you can quickly look them up. If anything is wrong since I haven't updated the list in a long time, let me know too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-29T14:16:12-07:00","id":121981,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/121559-rage-across-google-maps?p=121944#post121944\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This would be incredibly useful.</div> </div> </div> </div>Will see can I dig it out so.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Laughing Hyena</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/121559-rage-across-google-maps?p=121966#post121966\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"http://laughinghyena.livejournal.com/102494.html\" target=\"_blank\">I have a old list of caerns and locations that I did for the Rage CCG fourms to use for the sources on cards, it hasn't been updated in a long time (So it doesn't have anything from W20 books)</a>.<br /> It should have page numbers and book titles, so you can quickly look them up. If anything is wrong since I haven't updated the list in a long time, let me know too.</div> </div> </div> </div>Super quick correction/info for you - Brugh Na Boinne Caern is the Tri-Spiral. It's a misspelling of <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Br%C3%BA_na_B%C3%B3inne\" target=\"_blank\">Br\u00fa na B\u00f3inne</a>. Worst location for a Caern ever :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/836-obyrne","name":"Obyrne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar836_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"149"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-29T14:47:18-07:00","id":121998,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Obyrne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/121559-rage-across-google-maps?p=121981#post121981\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Super quick correction/info for you - Brugh Na Boinne Caern is the Tri-Spiral. It's a misspelling of <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Br%C3%BA_na_B%C3%B3inne\" target=\"_blank\">Br\u00fa na B\u00f3inne</a>. Worst location for a Caern ever :P</div> </div> </div> </div>Well its actually no more stupid than the caern at Washington monument park or the one at central park. Infact if we just leave out of equation the fact that bru na Boinne is a world heritage-site and a huge tourist magnet -which never would be so in OWoD for obvious reasons that its a major caern. though more realistic option is that the caern would have been discovered and destroyed long ago instead of being a scenario in apocalypse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1700-blue-fox","name":"Blue Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1700_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-29T15:21:23-07:00","id":122028,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blue Fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/121559-rage-across-google-maps?p=121998#post121998\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well its actually no more stupid than the caern at Washington monument park or the one at central park. Infact if we just leave out of equation the fact that bru na Boinne is a world heritage-site and a huge tourist magnet -which never would be so in OWoD for obvious reasons that its a major caern. though more realistic option is that the caern would have been discovered and destroyed long ago instead of being a scenario in apocalypse.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm more than happy to compromise with &quot;one of the worst locations ever for a Caern&quot;. :P<br /> <br /> That said, the world-heritage-site is just the tip of the iceberg for problems with it. Everything from the location (inside the Pale), to the history associated with it (wrong time period and culture), to the wide open countryside surrounding it, is wrong for a Fianna Caern. It's especially iffy given there's a lot of non-world-heritage sites that match the mythology better and aren't even mentioned (Emhain Macha for example).<br /> <br /> Basically the best reason we can locally figure for its choice is someone saw a tourist brochure and went &quot;that's Irish...that'll do&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/836-obyrne","name":"Obyrne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar836_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"149"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-29T20:57:23-07:00","id":122179,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Laughing Hyena</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/121559-rage-across-google-maps?p=121966#post121966\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Also, what's your stance on caerns from Magazine adventures? I know the ones from White Wolf Magazine and Inphobia Magazine should be fine, but I know of a few from Non-White Wolf Magazines (Shadis Magazine had a caern located near the La Brea Tar Pits, Valkyrie Magazine had a ton of CWOD adventures, etc.). As well as caerns from White Wolf novels and anthologies?<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://laughinghyena.livejournal.com/102494.html\" target=\"_blank\">I have a old list of caerns and locations that I did for the Rage CCG fourms to use for the sources on cards, it hasn't been updated in a long time (So it doesn't have anything from W20 books)</a>.<br /> It should have page numbers and book titles, so you can quickly look them up. If anything is wrong since I haven't updated the list in a long time, let me know too.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was originally going with an &quot;as long as they are official and have a stat bloc&quot; stance, but I realized even that wasn't necessary. So my stance is, instead, &quot;as long as it is canon or officially sanctioned&quot; because I can at least mention them even if no other information is known. <span style=\"font-size:10px\">(Like with the Sept of the Night Sky, the bane in my ass. Did you know that in World of Rage it mentions the Sept being near the Danube in northern Hungary? Do you know where Wallachia/Romania isn't? And that's the only more-specific information I've found so far. Why you do this me, White Wolf.)</span> So, if the content in the magazines became canon, like how Dragon magazine was for WotC, then I'll those to the official layer. Otherwise, I'll just put them in the custom layer with the others.<br /> <br /> Long story short, they'll be added one way or another, it just changes what their header will be.<br /> <br /> The only ones I'm not going to add at the moment, or will at least be saving for last, are Caerns that give me no locational information at all. Sept of the Night Sky at least gives me a country, I guess. Haha.<br /> <br /> That list of yours is very helpful, thank you for sharing it!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><a href=\"http://thecyberrecord.net\" target=\"_blank\">The Cyber Record</a> is on the </span></b><a href=\"http://geomid.network\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Geomid.Network</span></b></a><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Activism is Gaian praxis</span></b></div> <div align=\"right\"> <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><a href=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" ><img itemprop=\"image\" data-align=\"center\" data-linktype=\"1\" data-linkurl=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" data-size=\"full\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-thumb-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center\" /></a></div><br /> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2810-yakecen-sings","name":"Yakecen-Sings","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2810_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-30T03:48:30-07:00","id":122261,"title":"","content":"Rage Across the World has alot of caern and sept locations. In case nobody mentioned it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/494-exalted-viovode","name":"Exalted Viovode","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"123"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-17T20:24:10-08:00","id":1018658,"title":"","content":"This is one of the most useful things ever.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7150-nuitloupe","name":"Nuitloupe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7150_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-18T00:35:35-08:00","id":1018727,"title":"","content":"Hey Nuitloupe! I got your PM but can't message you back for some reason, so I'll just reply here.<br /> <br /> You are of course welcome to send me details about your homebrew Caerns to add to the map. I have a layer of custom locations for just that purpose. If you already know exactly where you want the map pins placed, send those coordinates along with the info. If you'd like to include a URL for your game's website/forum/etc, feel free to do that also and I'll make sure it's in each of the entries.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><a href=\"http://thecyberrecord.net\" target=\"_blank\">The Cyber Record</a> is on the </span></b><a href=\"http://geomid.network\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Geomid.Network</span></b></a><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Activism is Gaian praxis</span></b></div> <div align=\"right\"> <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><a href=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" ><img itemprop=\"image\" data-align=\"center\" data-linktype=\"1\" data-linkurl=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" data-size=\"full\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-thumb-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center\" /></a></div><br /> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2810-yakecen-sings","name":"Yakecen-Sings","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2810_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-21T18:53:24-07:00","id":1132464,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:10px\">I made a little guide a while back but then forgot to post it.</span><br /> <br /> <br /> For people who would like to add their custom locations added to <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1Rpq50OlK4SzbMjzpxthzSPLcF4g&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Rage Across Google Maps</a>, there are two steps necessary :<br /> <br /> <b>Step 1</b><br /><br /> Providing the actual location. An easy way to do this is go to <a href=\"http://www.google.com/maps\" target=\"_blank\">www.google.com/maps</a>, find and then click on the spot where your map pin should go. This will bring up a small window at the bottom of the screen. At the bottom of that window, there be the coordinates for that spot. Click on the coordinates, then copy all of those numbers from the search bar they appear in on the left, and include them with step 2. If you need a visual reference, see the bottom of this page.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Step 2</b><br /><br /> Use the following template, replacing anything in <i>italics</i> with your information, then send it to me in a Private Message (so I am more likely to see it right away):<br /> <br /> <hr /> <br /> <i>Paste your map coordinates here</i><br /> <br /> <b>Caern: </b><i>A brief description of what or where the Caern's heart is</i><br /> <br /> <b>Level</b> <i>number</i> | <b>Gauntlet</b> <i>number</i><br /> <br /> <b>Type: </b><i>Caern's type (not the Totem's type)</i><br /> <br /> <b>Totem:</b> <i>Caern's Totem</i><br /> <br /> <b>Tribal Structure: </b><i>The Tribe/Changing Breed primarily in control, or mixed. Is it Open or Closed to outsiders?</i><br /> <i>Write your description of the Caern, Sept, important things or people here. I don't know if Google Maps has a text limit, but it's best to keep it about the length you might find in a source book.<br /> <br /> [The game that this place is from, you can include a link to it here]</i><br /> <br /> <hr /> <br /> If you need a visual reference for Step 1, here is what to do if you wanted to place a map pin at the southernmost point of Greenland, for example:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#3A3A3A\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><i><img src=\"https://vignette4.wikia.nocookie.net/thecyberrecord/images/d/d9/Step1-1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20170412090131\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><img src=\"https://vignette2.wikia.nocookie.net/thecyberrecord/images/9/97/Step1-2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/550?cb=20170412090151\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></i><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> </span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><a href=\"http://thecyberrecord.net\" target=\"_blank\">The Cyber Record</a> is on the </span></b><a href=\"http://geomid.network\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Geomid.Network</span></b></a><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Activism is Gaian praxis</span></b></div> <div align=\"right\"> <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><a href=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" ><img itemprop=\"image\" data-align=\"center\" data-linktype=\"1\" data-linkurl=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" data-size=\"full\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-thumb-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center\" /></a></div><br /> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2810-yakecen-sings","name":"Yakecen-Sings","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2810_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-23T09:51:31-07:00","id":1133053,"title":"","content":"This is awesome, cool.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13562-lordmagnusen","name":"lordmagnusen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-01T12:58:12-07:00","id":1136333,"title":"","content":"Very cool.<br /> <br /> (Though I'm a bit disturbed that when looking up one of the Caerns near where I live, I came across my car parked at work.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-05T09:54:09-07:00","id":1137727,"title":"","content":"Oh yes, there's always a bit of a creep Big Brother factor about Google Maps/Earth. The Weaver Sees All.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><a href=\"http://thecyberrecord.net\" target=\"_blank\">The Cyber Record</a> is on the </span></b><a href=\"http://geomid.network\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Geomid.Network</span></b></a><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Activism is Gaian praxis</span></b></div> <div align=\"right\"> <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><a href=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" ><img itemprop=\"image\" data-align=\"center\" data-linktype=\"1\" data-linkurl=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" data-size=\"full\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-thumb-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center\" /></a></div><br /> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2810-yakecen-sings","name":"Yakecen-Sings","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2810_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-08T10:04:43-07:00","id":1138620,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yakecen-Sings</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/121559-rage-across-google-maps#post121559\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I give you <a href=\"https://mapsengine.google.com/map/edit?mid=zMs5hU48Utl8.kEi7ZJCM2TRQ\" target=\"_blank\">Rage Across Google Maps</a>, a map reference of Septs and Caerns across the World of Darkness..</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you. Very helpful.<br /> <br /> See this similar thing: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1T3bUOaBnUBLDry3WGeyxODPJ4gs&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Dark Ages 1230 Google Map</a><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3760-flint","name":"flint","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3760_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-24T02:16:38-08:00","id":1162127,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yakecen-Sings</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/121559-rage-across-google-maps#post121559\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I give you <a href=\"http://&quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">https://mapsengine.google.com/map/edit?mid=zMs5hU48Utl8.kEi7ZJCM2TRQ&quot;]Rage</a> Across Google Maps[/URL], a map reference of Septs and Caerns across the World of Darkness.<br /> <br /> I'm still combing through books and making additions. Once I've finished with Garou territories, I'll see about Fera. The map is intended as a visual aid for storytellers and players alike, and all location entries should have their source cited so you know what book to open to learn more about that site. If there a book or page number missing, please let me know so I can fix it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wow, that's huge man. And very helpful. I can't wait to see fera caern added. And 2 more things: first of all I found also other map of septs here: <br /> <a href=\"https://www.google.pl/url?sa=t&amp;source=web&amp;rct=j&amp;url=https://www.google.com/maps/d/viewer%3Fmid%3D1gqUF4rPQj53Yb6ip4xoY8EfBmn8%26hl%3Den_US&amp;ved=0ahUKEwjKoJuQ-tbXAhWSDewKHaR4DpIQFgglMAA&amp;usg=AOvVaw2T55pETOBiCCeOXte9V4T6\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.google.pl/url?sa=t&amp;sourc...BiCCeOXte9V4T6</a><br /> There are some differences between your map and that one. Maybe you want to compare it with yours. And the second thing: you missed at least 1 caern. The one I've found is Norge Valley Caern, level 2, gaunlet 4, type Vision/Nightmares, status abandoned (formerly Wendigo later Black Spiral Dancers) from Project Twilight p. 98. And another one, faerie site that could be a caern, in Catskill protectorate, mentioned in Rage across New York p. 26.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":13141,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","user":"Nail Eater","date":". 11-24-2017, 06:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-02T17:09:14-07:00","id":1202350,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nail Eater</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/121559-rage-across-google-maps?p=1162127#post1162127\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There are some differences between your map and that one. Maybe you want to compare it with yours. And the second thing: you missed at least 1 caern. The one I've found is Norge Valley Caern, level 2, gaunlet 4, type Vision/Nightmares, status abandoned (formerly Wendigo later Black Spiral Dancers) from Project Twilight p. 98. And another one, faerie site that could be a caern, in Catskill protectorate, mentioned in Rage across New York p. 26.</div> </div> </div> </div> Thanks for those notes, I'll seek them out when I have the time to do another big update!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><a href=\"http://thecyberrecord.net\" target=\"_blank\">The Cyber Record</a> is on the </span></b><a href=\"http://geomid.network\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Geomid.Network</span></b></a><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Activism is Gaian praxis</span></b></div> <div align=\"right\"> <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><a href=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" ><img itemprop=\"image\" data-align=\"center\" data-linktype=\"1\" data-linkurl=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" data-size=\"full\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-thumb-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center\" /></a></div><br /> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2810-yakecen-sings","name":"Yakecen-Sings","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2810_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-04T11:37:59-07:00","id":1203078,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yakecen-Sings</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.th